---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use — Quinocycle" description="Terms of use for www.quinocycle.com.my and terms of sale for Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. packaging products.">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-4">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: 2 July 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">1. About These Terms</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">These terms govern your use of www.quinocycle.com.my, operated by Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. of No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300, Malaysia. By using this website you agree to these terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">2. Products and Pricing</h2>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Prices shown on this website are indicative and in Malaysian Ringgit (RM). Final pricing is confirmed at the time of quotation or order, and may vary with quantity, stock, and delivery location.</li>
          <li>Used carton boxes are graded, pre-owned stock. Appearance (markings, print, minor scuffs) varies by batch; structural condition is inspected before sale.</li>
          <li>Product availability changes with incoming stock. Listing a product on this website is not a guarantee of availability.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">3. Orders, Payment, and Delivery</h2>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Orders are placed via WhatsApp, phone, or email and are confirmed once we acknowledge the order and payment terms.</li>
          <li>Delivery timelines within Klang Valley and Peninsular Malaysia are estimates and depend on courier or transport schedules.</li>
          <li>Please inspect goods on delivery or collection and raise any issues with us within 48 hours.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">4. Website Content</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Content on this website — including blog articles, guides, prices, and specifications — is provided for general information. While we keep it as accurate as we can, it does not constitute professional advice, and figures such as cost savings are estimates that vary by situation. All content, branding, and images belong to Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. or their respective owners and may not be reproduced for commercial use without permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">To the fullest extent permitted by Malaysian law, Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd. is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of this website or from the use of products beyond their intended purpose. Nothing in these terms excludes rights you have under the Consumer Protection Act 1999 where it applies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">6. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">These terms are governed by the laws of Malaysia, and any disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the Malaysian courts.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:quinocycle@gmail.com" class="text-primary underline">quinocycle@gmail.com</a> or call +60 16 8916 381.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
